    {
      "id": "5cd65206338efd1ba6442a24da6f95365419fd5a",
      "individual_note": false,
      "resolvable": true,
      "resolved": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2163886108,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Oups too late\n\nCan you look Clang Analyzer Warning :\n\n```\npacket-smb2.c:5558:6: warning: Access to field 'saved' results in a dereference of a null pointer (loaded from variable 'si') [core.NullDereference]\npacket-smb2.c:8874:6: warning: Access to field 'saved' results in a dereference of a null pointer (loaded from variable 'si') [core.NullDereference]\npacket-smb2.c:9984:7: warning: Access to field 'saved' results in a dereference of a null pointer (loaded from variable 'si') [core.NullDereference]\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 279822,
            "username": "alagoutte",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Alexis La Goutte",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a15cba6417f4d1723eb56add7099bcfd8df373dc520577958b33c37915ef231b?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/alagoutte"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-10-17T14:11:20.801Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-10-17T14:36:08.619Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 334595804,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 17690,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 2163952281,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Those particular lines have been there for 12 years, so I *think* this is a case of Clang static analyzer noting that a null pointer check was added for `si` on, e.g., line 5552 and assuming that means that `si` might be NULL on 5558.\n\nI think that on line 5552 in fact `si` can't be NULL, but it's possible that `si->saved` can be, so the only NULL pointer check really needed is for the latter.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-10-17T14:36:08.550Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-10-17T14:36:08.550Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 334595804,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 17690,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 2164878766,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It appears you are saying that I do *not* need to change 5558 from \"if\n(si->saved)\" to \"if (si && si->saved)\". Is that correct?",
          "author": {
            "id": 6901460,
            "username": "cturney111",
            "public_email": "cturney111@gmail.com",
            "name": "Cal Turney",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/6901460/avatar.png?v=1782345656",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/cturney111"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-10-17T23:25:15.212Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-10-17T23:25:15.212Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 334595804,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 17690,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 2164947704,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I believe that's correct. In those functions in general, `si` always exists, but not necessarily `si->saved`; the null pointer dereferences that have been occurring are because `si->saved` is NULL. However, some of the static analysis warnings will complain about checking whether `si` is NULL when it cannot possibly be NULL.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-10-18T00:50:09.709Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-10-18T00:50:09.709Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 334595804,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 17690,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 2164951868,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "See !17700 - `si->saved` needs to be checked everywhere before it is dereferenced, but `si` does *not* need to be checked.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
